ure. The system automates search optimization through a closed loop: query validation, experimental planning, candidate strategy generation, batch search execution, relevance labeling, metric calculation, result comparison, and candidate scene creation. A core component is the SPA (Strategy Population Annealing) framework, which intelligently allocates evaluation budgets using multi-fidelity testing, multi-perspective elite selection, and semantic evolution to find robust, explainable search configurations.\n\nTesting across three business datasets showed offline improvements of 11.66%–13.50% for NDCG@20 and up to 21.17% for Precision@10. The CLI layer adds essential engineering capabilities including cost planning, controlled concurrency, label caching, and checkpoint/resume functionality. The tool requires Node.js 20+ and is licensed under Apache-2.0."}, "settings": {}}